WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.264
Review the relationship map. Confirm the linked child, guardian, pickup and emergency contact. Similar names do not justify merging records.

00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:31.800
Check the family details. Review the billing email and address against the approved school record. Access and payment controls are separate.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:42.336
Check the selected child. Read the child name, status and classroom before entering any child-specific information.

00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:53.274
Review before saving. No change is needed in this example. If a relationship or record is wrong, stop and resolve it before inviting, billing or sharing.

